Domain writes require allow_writes=true. Missing required variables skip requests rather than selecting real records automatically.

Requires the admin role or the dentist role without the receptionist role. Dentists may collaborate on clinic notes; authorship remains immutable and changed notes capture the authenticated last editor. Omitted fields are preserved. Relationship validation checks the merged note and appointment. Explicit appointment_id null detaches the appointment. Changes atomically append a minimal audit record and publish an after-commit ClinicalNoteChanged event with actor and before/after snapshots. No-op updates preserve metadata and produce neither an audit record nor an event. Audit storage excludes clinical text and event snapshots; storage failures roll back the mutation. See docs/audit-logging.md.

